There is something fishy with your numbers. As rnz uses rne for 
character level part and rne gives same variations for levels 1-17, 
18-20, 21-23, 24-26, 27-29 and 30 those values should be same. As for 
minimum amd maximum: rn2(x) returns 0..x-1 not 1..x. So rnz(1000) 
maximum for XL 30 character is not 20000 but 19990.

On average rnz(x) = 1.32*x.

